    <briefdescription>
<para>List that automatically updates parent links and symbol tables. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When nodes are inserted into and removed from this list, the associated symbol table will be automatically updated. Similarly, parent links get updated automatically. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
